;; mesh-map (FEAT-018 S-B) — scatter + gather fused: the 90% fan-out.
;;
;; Spawn one await-free child per item (uniform shared prefix + region), then
;; await them all and return the results in order. The common parallel-map over a
;; collection of missions. Composes the two primitives directly (no new mechanism)
;; so it stays the same await-free shape FEAT-011 ships.
;;
;; Args (data/*):
;;   items           — the collection to map missions over (required).
;;   prompt          — shared prompt prefix; each child gets (str prompt item).
;;   region          — the shared region the cohort coordinates in.
;;   tools           — optional capability subset for every child.
;;   inherit-memory  — optional uniform def-env slice for every child.
;;
;; Returns [result ...] — the awaited result of each item's child, in order.
(let [handles (map (fn [item]
                     (tool/spawn-session {:prompt (str data/prompt item)
                                          :region data/region
                                          :tools data/tools
                                          :inherit-memory data/inherit-memory}))
                   data/items)]
  (map (fn [h] (tool/await-session {:handle h})) handles))
